      "content": "Thanks. One thing though—the new system is going to be much more lightweight. It mostly uses hardcoded heuristic rules and basic FIFO logic for the edge nodes to keep things fast. Basically, it won't need the deep predictive modeling or the massive compute loads you're currently running. Do you see any issues with us moving away from your complex reasoning models in favor of these simpler rules?",
